### ==================== Auth APIs ====================

### Login - Get Authentication Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data.token); %}

###
### Register User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "New User",
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}

###
### Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ==================== Admin User APIs ====================

### 1. Get All Users (Paginated with Filters)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Get All Users with Search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users?page=0&size=20&search=user
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Get All Users with Status Filter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users?page=0&size=20&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Get All Users with Role Filter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users?page=0&size=20&role=ROLE_USER
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Get User Detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ==================== User Management APIs ====================

### Lock User
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/2/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Unlock User
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/2/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Delete User
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Change User Role
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/2/role
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ROLE_INTERVIEWER"
}

###
### Reset Password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/2/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ==================== Audit Log APIs ====================

### Get Audit Logs (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/audit-logs?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Get Audit Logs - Next Page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/audit-logs?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ==================== Error Test Cases ====================

### Test: Get User Detail (Invalid ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Test: Lock Already Locked User
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/2/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Test: Change Own Role (Should Fail)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/1/role
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}

###
### Test: Delete Own Account (Should Fail)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
